sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Asr as assurance loop
    participant Srv as Tool server
    participant Canon as canon
    participant Scr as screen
    participant Reg as registry
    participant Med as wc-mediator
    actor Owner
    actor AppSec

    loop every reattest_every (tier-derived)
        Asr->>Srv: tools/list
        Srv-->>Asr: current declared surface
        Asr->>Canon: canonicalise
        Canon-->>Asr: canonical bytes
        Asr->>Asr: sha256 vs pin
        alt hash matches
            Asr->>Reg: refresh last_attested_at
        else mismatch
            Asr->>Asr: semantic diff (tools, descriptions, params, endpoint)
            Asr->>Scr: re-screen new text
            Scr-->>Asr: findings or clean
            alt benign, standing policy allows
                Asr->>Reg: auto-update pin, record event
            else material
                Asr->>Reg: posture -> degraded
                Asr->>Med: suspend every contract referencing this pin
                Med-->>Asr: acknowledged
                Asr->>Owner: notify with diff
                Asr->>AppSec: WC-5002 drift material
                AppSec->>Reg: re-approval re-runs admission
                Reg-->>AppSec: new pin, new contracts
            end
        end
    end
